  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0">
   <div class="wrap">
    <div class="prose" style="margin-bottom:clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4rem)" data-reveal>
     <div class="box-note"><span class="eyebrow">Working frameworks</span><p>Models I keep and revise, distilled from essays, talks and practice. They are tools for thinking, not final answers, and they change as I learn.</p></div>
